          "message": {
            "text": "The generated corpus includes both isolated transitions and every pair of non-default states. Isolated rows make each axis independently attributable; pair rows catch interactions that a one-axis-at-a-time suite cannot, while 28 total capture rows remain practical as an always-on CI gate.",
            "markdown": "The generated corpus includes both isolated transitions and every pair of non-default states. Isolated rows make each axis independently attributable; pair rows catch interactions that a one-axis-at-a-time suite cannot, while 28 total capture rows remain practical as an always-on CI gate."
          },
          "locations": [
